{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"欢喜过后，他有些出神，心里柔软而满足。先前的期待已有了分量，他此刻能体会到亲近本身带来的充实。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"亲近本身带来的满足，也成为他珍惜的东西。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"全段总体更接近对已有欢喜的沉浸与回味，前文期待逐渐变得珍贵，足以解释这份满足为何如此真切。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选13\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他开始悬心，这份亲近在对方心里是否也同样珍贵。先前那份期待已有分量，所以它能否延续，也开始牵涉到对方的心意。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始在意，这份亲近是否也被对方珍惜。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"段内局部的急切感为关系中的悬念提供了支撑，也让前文对亲近能否延续的牵挂进一步落到彼此是否同样珍惜上。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选1\",\n        \"候选11\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6d231f31-9ddf-473e-98e9-d629d63c3f7a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T033434267954Z", "elapsed_seconds": 132.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:36:47.167369+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "31187eee48c77cdccd5b659d5c447309a4d90b781619c1f261197d99e729cdda", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07